        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "feat(ios): implement branded typography design system",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nThe iOS app currently uses the system font (SF Pro) throughout, providing no visual brand identity. This makes the app feel generic and indistinguishable from default iOS apps.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nIntroduces a branded typography system using Plus Jakarta Sans (headings), DM Sans (body), and JetBrains Mono (code). All fonts are bundled with SIL OFL 1.1 license. Typography tokens (`OpenClawType`) support Dynamic Type accessibility scaling. Shared design components (spacing, radius, toggle, badge, button styles) consolidate scattered magic values into reusable tokens.\n\nThis is a cosmetic-only change — no behavioral, routing, or structural modifications. Existing Chat behavior (empty-state intro, gateway accessibility hooks) is preserved.\n\n## User Impact\n\nUsers see a refined, branded typeface across all iOS screens (Settings, Chat, Onboarding, Agent views). Dynamic Type continues to work. No functional behavior changes.\n\n## Evidence\n\n### Before/After Screenshots (iPhone 17 Pro, iOS 26)\n\n**Settings — Light Mode**\n\n| Before (`upstream/main`) | After (this PR) |\n|:---:|:---:|\n| ![before-settings-light](https://iili.io/CYevB14.png) | ![after-settings-light](https://iili.io/CYevCrl.png) |\n\nTypography change: SF Pro → Plus Jakarta Sans for headings/labels, DM Sans for body text.\n\n**Settings — Dark Mode**\n\n| Before (`upstream/main`) | After (this PR) |\n|:---:|:---:|\n| ![before-settings-dark](https://iili.io/CYevMTF.png) | ![after-settings-dark](https://iili.io/CYevjEv.png) |\n\n**Chat — Light Mode**\n\n| Before (`upstream/main`) | After (this PR) |\n|:---:|:---:|\n| ![before-chat-light](https://iili.io/CYevO2p.png) | ![after-chat-light](https://iili.io/CYeveYN.png) |\n\nChat view shows font swap in agent name, message text, and placeholder. \"Connected\" pill uses `OpenClawStatusBadge` with preserved accessibility hooks.\n\n---\n\n### Build verification\n\n```\n$ git log --oneline upstream/main..HEAD\n251153bb13 fix(ios): remove leaked location capability and restore chat hooks\n08c5f33354 feat(ios): implement branded typography design system\n\n$ pnpm native:i18n:check\nnative-app-i18n: entries=2365 changed=false ✓\n\n$ xcodebuild build -scheme OpenClaw -quiet\n# Build Succeeded (no errors)\n```\n\n### ClawSweeper findings addressed\n\n- ✅ Removed leaked `UIBackgroundModes: location` from project.yml and Info.plist\n- ✅ Restored `emptyAssistantIntro: \"What would you like to work on?\"` in ChatProTab\n- ✅ Restored `.accessibilityIdentifier(\"chat-gateway-status\")` and `.accessibilityLabel(gatewayAccessibilityLabel)`\n- ✅ Restored `gatewayAccessibilityLabel` computed property\n\n### Fonts bundled (all SIL OFL 1.1)\n\n| Font | Weight variants | Source | License |\n|------|----------------|--------|---------|\n| Plus Jakarta Sans | Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Bold, ExtraBold | [tokotype/PlusJakartaSans](https://github.com/nickshanks/PlusJakartaSans) | SIL OFL 1.1 |\n| DM Sans | Light, Regular, Medium, SemiBold, Italic | [googlefonts/dm-fonts](https://github.com/googlefonts/dm-fonts) | SIL OFL 1.1 |\n| JetBrains Mono | Regular, Medium, SemiBold | [JetBrains/JetBrainsMono](https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono) | SIL OFL 1.1 |\n\nFull license text at `apps/ios/Sources/Fonts/LICENSE`.\n\n### Scope — what is NOT in this PR\n\n- No background location / UIBackgroundModes changes\n- No accent color changes\n- No RootTabs/navigation behavior changes\n- No Settings routing changes\n- No onboarding structural changes\n- No Chat behavior changes (empty-state intro and gateway hooks preserved)\n\nSupersedes #99161 (closed, stale branch history).\n\n## Real behavior proof (required for external PRs)\n\n- Behavior or issue addressed: iOS app uses system font; this PR adds branded custom typography tokens\n- Real environment tested: macOS 15.5, Xcode 26.0, iPhone 17 Pro Simulator (iOS 26), Node 24\n- Exact steps or command run after this patch: `pnpm ios:gen && xcodebuild build -scheme OpenClaw -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,id=0379DDE4' -quiet && xcrun simctl install && xcrun simctl launch --openclaw-screenshot-mode`\n- Evidence after fix (screenshot): See before/after screenshots above — captured fresh from `upstream/main` vs this PR head on same simulator device\n- Observed result after fix: All text renders with branded fonts (Plus Jakarta Sans headings, DM Sans body, JetBrains Mono code); Dynamic Type scales correctly; no behavioral regressions in Chat empty state or gateway status hooks; no location capability in built Info.plist\n- What was not tested: Physical device, iPad layout, VoiceOver full pass\n- Proof limitations or environment constraints: Simulator-only proof; font rendering verified visually but no pixel-diff automation\n\n— [Joel Nishanth](https://offlyn.ai) · [offlyn.AI](https://offlyn.ai)",
